
.subckt astra_044_cmos_pulse_width_discriminator vdd VSS iref inp vref vb out
CL out VSS 200f
CT net1 VSS 1p
M1 iref iref vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M10 net0 net2 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M11 net5 vb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M12 below net0 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M13 below net0 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M14 net3 below vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M15 out inb net3 vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M16 out below VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M17 out inb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 net4 iref vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M3 net1 inb net4 vdd APMOS l=1u w=40u
M4 net1 inb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=40u
M5 inb inp vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 inb inp VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M7 net2 net1 net5 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M8 net0 vref net5 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M9 net2 net2 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
RL net1 VSS 1G
.ends astra_044_cmos_pulse_width_discriminator
